## 8. Steam Sales — `game_recommender/steam_sales.py`

**`SaleGame` dataclass:**
- `name: str`, `app_id: str`, `discount_percent: int`, `original_price_cents: int`,
  `sale_price_cents: int`, `from_wishlist: bool = False`, `genres: list[str]`
- Property `original_price -> str`: `f"${cents/100:.2f}"` or `"unknown"` if 0
- Property `sale_price -> str`: `f"${cents/100:.2f}"` or `"free"` if 0

**`get_featured_specials(min_discount=40) -> list[SaleGame]`**
- GET `https://store.steampowered.com/api/featuredcategories/?cc=us&l=en`, timeout 10s
- Parse `data["specials"]["items"]`
- Skip if `discount_percent < min_discount` or no `id`
- Returns sorted by `discount_percent` descending

**`get_wishlist_on_sale(api_key, user_id, min_discount=20, max_check=100, progress_callback=None) -> list[SaleGame]`**
- GET `https://api.steampowered.com/IWishlistService/GetWishlist/v1/` to fetch wishlist items
- Sort by `date_added` descending, cap at `max_check`
- Process in batches of 20 via `https://store.steampowered.com/api/appdetails`:
  - `appids=comma,joined`, `filters=basic,price_overview,genres`, `cc=us`, `l=en`
  - Sleep 0.4s between batches (rate limiting)
  - Batch exceptions are swallowed (non-fatal — skip and continue)
  - `genres` from `info["genres"][i]["description"]`
- Returns sorted by `discount_percent` descending

**`get_all_sales(min_discount=40, steam_api_key=None, steam_user_id=None, include_wishlist=True, owned_app_ids=None, progress_callback=None) -> list[SaleGame]`**
- Calls `get_featured_specials` (wrapped in try/except)
- If `include_wishlist and steam_api_key and steam_user_id`, calls `get_wishlist_on_sale`
- Both are filtered against `owned_app_ids`
- Merges: wishlist first, then featured. Deduplicates by `app_id` (first occurrence wins,
  so wishlist version takes priority if same game appears in both)

